# Pinned PGP signing-key fingerprints for Electrum (one 40-hex fingerprint per
# line, spaces ignored; lines starting with # are comments; any other line,
# a key ID included, refuses the download). Each platform's updater
# requires its own Electrum download to carry a VALIDSIG from one of these
# keys, checked against its detached .asc signature.
#
# ThomasV (Electrum maintainer). Verify independently before trusting:
#   https://electrum.org/  ->  "Signature" / GPG section
#   key id 0x2BD5824B7F9470E6
